flowchart TD
    START([Start]) --> LOGIN[Login]
    LOGIN --> VALID{Valid Login?}
    VALID -->|No| LOGIN
    VALID -->|Yes| CONFIG[Configure Simulation]
    CONFIG --> STRATEGY[Select Strategy<br/>smart / baseline]
    STRATEGY --> SEED[Enter Seed]
    SEED --> RUN[Run Simulation<br/>POST /api/run]
    RUN --> INIT[Initialize Orchestrator]
    INIT --> LOAD[Load Incident Dataset<br/>input_data.json / custom_incidents]
    LOAD --> DETECT[Incident Detection]
    DETECT --> ML{Smart strategy<br/>and ML model available?}
    ML -->|Yes| PREDICT[Severity Prediction<br/>Random Forest]
    ML -->|No| RULES[Rule-based Priority]
    PREDICT --> ALLOC[Resource Allocation]
    RULES --> ALLOC
    ALLOC --> RESCUE[Rescue Coordination]
    RESCUE --> EVAL[Evaluation]
    EVAL --> METRICS[Save Metrics<br/>save_run_metrics]
    METRICS --> UPDATEDB[Update Database<br/>incidents · agent_logs · run_logs]
    UPDATEDB --> COMPLETE[complete_run]
    COMPLETE --> REPORTS[Generate Reports<br/>CSV / PDF]
    REPORTS --> DISPLAY[Display Dashboard<br/>Analytics · Live Map]
    DISPLAY --> END([End])
